{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1182565-manitou-preview-is-up","id":1182565,"title":"Manitou Preview is up!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-02-05T05:57:21-08:00","id":1182565,"title":"Manitou Preview is up!","content":"The Manitou Preview is up! Check it out!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/scion-2nd-edition-tabletop-rpg/posts/2106554\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects.../posts/2106554</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">&quot;We have done the impossible, and that makes us mighty.&quot;<br /> Captain Malcolm Reynolds</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/679-unnatural1","name":"unnatural1","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-05T09:25:43-08:00","id":1182629,"title":"","content":"I must say, I pity the Manitou explaining why you should take their monsters seriously.<br /> <br /> &quot;Okay, so, there's this giant killer skunk-&quot;<br /> <br /> *snicker*<br /> <br /> &quot;A <i>legendary</i> beast that now exists within all its lesser brethren and always threatens to rebuild itself-&quot;<br /> <br /> *barely suppressed laughter*<br /> <br /> &quot;WHICH IF REBORN WILL UNLEASH MUSK SO POTENT IT SPREADS PLAGUE ON FOUL WIND-&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;BWAHAHAHAHAHAA!&quot;<br /> <br /> *later*<br /> <br /> &quot;So, while we're hunting Ainwye, I suppose we should beware French cultists?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Uh?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;After all, they have mastered the art of farting in our general direction.&quot;<br /> <br /> *howl of rage*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-05T11:14:04-08:00","id":1182661,"title":"","content":"I really liked the preview. The pantheon is cool, the monsters are cool, and I'm glad to see the Orenda starting to be introduced. I know there's a bunch more of them, and I'd like to see more in the future, as well as the Wabanaki pantheon. Good stuff, and I'm glad to be educated on a pantheon I was only passingly familiar with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13079-wannabe-demon-lord","name":"Wannabe Demon Lord","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-05T13:55:45-08:00","id":1182694,"title":"","content":"Been waiting for this one!<br /> Muzzu-Kumik-Quae looks like she would have been a Titan in previous editions. Yet to see if this pantheon has actual Titans -- oh, they have, the next writeup mentions one.<br /> &quot;One manifestation in particular, called Tekawerahkwa, gave birth to two very different sons<br /> who frequently do battle with the sons of Winonah.&quot; What's this about? I'll look it up after class but... maybe also during class...<br /> Man, Wisakedjak sure is a Mantle.<br /> Tawiscara reminds me of Nobilis' Hell. Of which I am a fan.<br /> It's always fun seeing what transliterations are actually useful; I'm used to calling the mishibizhiw mishupishu. And by fun, I mean hell.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>But sexually.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1797-ellis","name":"Ellis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1797_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-05T15:59:34-08:00","id":1182731,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ellis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1182565-manitou-preview-is-up?p=1182694#post1182694\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Been waiting for this one!<br /> Muzzu-Kumik-Quae looks like she would have been a Titan in previous editions. Yet to see if this pantheon has actual Titans -- oh, they have, the next writeup mentions one.<br /> &quot;One manifestation in particular, called Tekawerahkwa, gave birth to two very different sons<br /> who frequently do battle with the sons of Winonah.&quot; What's this about? I'll look it up after class but... maybe also during class...</div> </div> </div> </div>I believe that's talking about the two Orenda brothers at the end of the list of the gods. They aren't Titans, they're just members of a conflicting related Pantheon (they're Iroquois rather than Algonquin), born from &quot;the First Woman&quot; in her Orenda Mantle of Tekawerahkwa, rather than her Manitou Mantle of Winonah.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-05T17:03:58-08:00","id":1182746,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1182565-manitou-preview-is-up?p=1182629#post1182629\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;So, while we're hunting Ainwye, I suppose we should beware French cultists?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>I thought you were going to go a different direction with this...<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://vignette.wikia.nocookie.net/looneytunes/images/f/f5/Lt_pepe.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20171107212704\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> &quot; <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Droid Sans\"> Do notcome wiz me to ze Casbah - we shall make beautiful musicks togezzer right here!&quot;<br /> </span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-05T17:13:01-08:00","id":1182749,"title":"","content":"It's unrelated, but the whole french thing made me think about it.<br /> Maudjee-Kawiss sounds very similar to a swear in french (well quebecker ... kinda). Now i know its a coincidence since the name most likely predate the arrival of the french language, but still. Its funny to my ears is what i mean.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Completed campaign: Scion 2nd Edition. Les L\u00e9gendes Currently playing: Being a dad for a 3 year old daughter and a 2 years old son and now a beautiful new baby.","edited":{"userid":11312,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","user":"Maitrecorbo","date":". 02-05-2018, 08:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","name":"Maitrecorbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11312_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"719"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-05T17:32:00-08:00","id":1182754,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wannabe Demon Lord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1182565-manitou-preview-is-up?p=1182661#post1182661\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I really liked the preview. The pantheon is cool, the monsters are cool, and I'm glad to see the Orenda starting to be introduced. I know there's a bunch more of them, and I'd like to see more in the future, as well as the Wabanaki pantheon. Good stuff, and I'm glad to be educated on a pantheon I was only passingly familiar with.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'm definitely interested to see the degree to which the Wabanaki deities would be separate entities or Mantles of these gods. Easy enough to make Gluscab and Malsumis Mantles of Nana and Cheeby, and Grandmother-Woodchuck (Agaskw) is already often called Nokemis! But at the same time Malsumis is usually portrayed far more malevolently than Cheeby (though that may be a foreign introduction to the stories, as wolves are not elsewhere malevolent in Wabenaki culture), and Pla-wee-noo as mother to Glooscab would conflate Winonah and Turtle Island itself together if you're treating these as the same deities.<br /> <br /> What's definitely rich depth too add from the Wabanaki are the host of lesser divinities and monsters to draw upon! The anthropomorphic personifications of the seasons, Azeban the lesser racoon/wolverine trickster spirit, soul-eating wizards with hearts of ice, etc etc.<br /> <br /> With Kita-skog and Pa-don-gi-ak you also have the Horned Serpent vs. Thunderbird dichotomy you find all over Algonquin and Siouan traditions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-05T17:44:02-08:00","id":1182760,"title":"","content":"Where can I learn more about this pantheon? I've tried googling the Gods and Godesses names and had no luck.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-05T17:52:34-08:00","id":1182761,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1182565-manitou-preview-is-up?p=1182760#post1182760\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Where can I learn more about this pantheon? I've tried googling the Gods and Godesses names and had no luck.</div> </div> </div> </div>Try googling without hyphens.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""}