ww.native-languages.org/chippewa-legends.htm</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you GW","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-05T18:03:24-08:00","id":1182769,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1182565-manitou-preview-is-up?p=1182746#post1182746\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I thought you were going to go a different direction with this...<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://vignette.wikia.nocookie.net/looneytunes/images/f/f5/Lt_pepe.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20171107212704\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> &quot; <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Droid Sans\"> Do notcome wiz me to ze Casbah - we shall make beautiful musicks togezzer right here!&quot;<br /> </span></span></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Come on, the other pantheons are not <i>that </i>cruel.<br /> <br /> Unless they are Loki, who is currently reviving that thing because it is a precious treasure that should never be forgotten.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-09T21:34:40-08:00","id":1184239,"title":"","content":"I love this preview! I'm hardly familiar with the Anishinaabe mythos so this was a good intro to that. <br /> <br /> Will the Iroquois pantheon be a separate pantheon on its own in the future? Do the Orenda adopt the Manitou's purview?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Scion 2e Homebrew Pantheon(s):<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LMQFZLq3NrOHs2cp7OWnfukuHCNI4h_0/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Nat, the Spirits of Myanmar</a><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1WDvOmQCR3a25WbVowfe8KgGbGLU0yzX3/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Phi, the Spirits of the Tai People</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13670-svarogg","name":"Svarogg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13670_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-09T22:13:23-08:00","id":1184247,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Svarogg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1182565-manitou-preview-is-up?p=1184239#post1184239\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I love this preview! I'm hardly familiar with the Anishinaabe mythos so this was a good intro to that.<br /> <br /> Will the Iroquois pantheon be a separate pantheon on its own in the future? Do the Orenda adopt the Manitou's purview?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I certainly hope we see more of their distinct gods too*, but with how the brothers are presented here I get the impression this is an Orisha/Loa type situation where there are shared Virtues and Pantheon Purview.<br /> <br /> *Most interesting would be that if we assume Iagentci is a Mantle of Nokomis, then the Orenda introduce several relative gods of hers on the other side of the sky who she had dealing with before falling to earth and becoming the first Manitou. Gasyondetha the meteor god, Hawenneyu the ruler of the sky realm, his spoiled daughter Doyadastethe the goddess of the dawn, Airesko the god of war &amp; the aurora borealis...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-09T23:02:38-08:00","id":1184264,"title":"","content":"In addition to Ioskeha and Tawiscara, here are the gods I'd include for the Orenda...<br /> <br /> Iagentci (Mantle of Nokomis)<br /> Eithinoha (Mantle of Muzzu-Kumik-Quae)<br /> Tekawerahkwa (Mantle of Winonah)<br /> <br /> Hawenneyu, celestial ruler of the pantheon, lawgiver, and keeper of daylight in heaven<br /> Doyadastethe, chief's wilfull daughter and goddess of the dawn, binds the hunter demigod Sosondowah in her service<br /> Gasyondetha, meteor god and rival for Iagentci's affections who played a role in her fall from heaven<br /> Akonwara, god of plantlife, partner to Eithinoha and father to the three crop demigoddesses and the strawberry demigod<br /> Shagodiaqdane, old woman goddess of summer who struggles against Tawiscara every year until she's chased off<br /> Aireskoi, celestial god of war and the aurora borealis<br /> Doendzowes, dancing scandalous goddess of earthquakes<br /> Otgoe, god of wampum shells and thus both commerce and record keeping<br /> Hodadeion, Otgoe's brother and god of magic, ascended adventurer in his own right<br /> <br /> <br /> Note that in the Orenda cosmology, Ioskeha's mantle of Tharonhiawakon is effectively a manifest avatar of the same greater Primordial that the Manitou call Kitchi-Manitou; and thus in that Mantle he speaks as Creator of All Things.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 02-10-2018, 05:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-10T10:57:30-08:00","id":1184451,"title":"","content":"It appears that the Orenda actually have even more workable members than the Manitou. It would be a shame not to expand on them.<br /> <br /> Gasyondetha (Gaasyandietha) might be more of a titan than a god given that he's he's fairly malignant and takes the form of a dragon or horned serpent.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13079-wannabe-demon-lord","name":"Wannabe Demon Lord","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-10T12:06:47-08:00","id":1184473,"title":"","content":"Yeah, that would work! A horned serpent Star-Titan would be pretty interesting.<br /> <br /> Geha of course is the Orenda name of the Titan Ae-pungishimook.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Another possible god for the Orenda would be Hinon the Thunderer. He might alternatively just be a particularly potent leader of the Thunderbird, but it could also be a Inari - Kitsune or Pan - Satyrs type relationship where Hinon is a full blown god.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-10T12:22:13-08:00","id":1184480,"title":"","content":"There's also the question of whether Hiawatha and the Great Peacemaker achieved Apotheosis. That might be crossing over into too deeply held messianic figures though to be appropriate at the game table (just as it's unlikely to see Jesus show up in the Elohim Pantheon, or Guatama Buddha in the Palas).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}